---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Client Portal
lang: en
description: The Foreign Immigration Services Client Portal brings your applications, documents, messages, payments and profile together in one place.
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
<section class="section trust-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="trust-section__inner">
      {{ icon("portal-applications", 52) }}
      <div>
        <p class="tag">Client Portal</p>
        <h1>Your Immigration Services, All in One Place</h1>
        <p>Access your applications and service requests, securely submit requested documents, follow progress, and manage payments through the Foreign Immigration Services Client Portal.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("portal-applications", 44) }}
        <h3>Applications &amp; Services</h3>
        <p>View and manage your immigration applications and service requests in one place, each with its own reference and status.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("portal-upload", 44) }}
        <h3>Documents</h3>
        <p>Securely submit and access the documents relevant to your applications and service requests.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("portal-enquiry", 44) }}
        <h3>Messages</h3>
        <p>Communicate directly with our team about your enquiry or application.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("portal-payments", 44) }}
        <h3>Payments</h3>
        <p>Review and settle applicable fees once the scope of services has been confirmed by our team.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("portal-profile", 44) }}
        <h3>Profile</h3>
        <p>Keep your contact and personal details up to date.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-cta">
      <h2>Get Started</h2>
      <p>Send us an enquiry and our team will guide you through the next steps for your Client Portal access.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Send an Enquiry</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
